  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Добавлена совместимость между Eating Animations и предметами еды из мода Artifacts, а также с некоторыми вариантами из расширений на тему Artifacts.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Совместимость с Bundle Texture Pack</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eating Animations More Mod Compatibility[NEO/FORGE]</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[FABRIC]</a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1751/483/639114741005949896.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"153\" height=\"153\"></em></a><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1748/995/639113051020661900.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"153\" height=\"153\"></a></em></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>Частичная совместимость с другими модами:</strong></em></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-quark-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1816/885/256/256/639148225207339732.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-aether-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1816/866/256/256/639148221311503481.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1816/873/256/256/639148222209502373.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-farmers-delight-add-ons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1816/875/256/256/639148223190593815.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1816/879/256/256/639148224173941263.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-artifacts\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1813/752/256/256/639146533871866822.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>Добавьте совместимость для модов с&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eating-animation-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eating Animations(NEO/FORGE)</a> &amp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eating-animation-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(FABRIC)</a> или <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modefite-item-definition-backport\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modefite</a></strong></p>\n<h3><strong>Совместимость с модами:</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/artifacts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Artifacts (Neo/Forge/Fabric)</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/artifacts-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Artifacts (Старая Fabric)</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fartifacts-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Artifacts Delight</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>Поддерживаемые версии:</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>1.16.x, </strong><strong>1.17.x, </strong><strong>1.18.x,&nbsp;</strong><strong>1.19.x,&nbsp;</strong><strong>1.20.x,&nbsp;</strong><strong>1.21.x, 26.x</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1546426/description_fab9a151-c264-4b08-8513-dd38f92b8f3a.png\"></strong></p>",
